+#### **Example**
+
+```
+  executable("my_program") {
+    sources = [ "my_program.cc" ]
+    validations = [ ":my_program_style_check" ]
+  }
+
+  action("my_program_style_check") {
+    script = "//tools/style_checker.py"
+    sources = [ "my_program.cc" ]
+    outputs = [ "$target_gen_dir/my_program_style_check.stamp" ]
